xplore all possible options to protect Scotland’s place in the EU\"\" (Source: http://www.ft.com/cms/s/0/4610a46e-3ae2-11e6-8716-a4a71e8140b0.html). A selection of other reliable news sources about this second referendum, http://www.bbc.co.uk/news/uk-scotland-scotland-politics-36621030 Brexit: Nicola Sturgeon says second Scottish independence vote 'highly likely' - BBC News, http://timesofoman.com/article/86708/World/Europe/New-Scotland-independence-referendum--quot;highly-likely-quot;---Sturgeon New Scotland independence referendum \"\"highly likely\"\" - Sturgeon - Times of Oman, http://www.standard.co.uk/news/uk/brexit-nicola-sturgeon-begins-paving-the-way-for-second-scottish-independence-referendum-a3280761.html - Brexit: Nicola Sturgeon begins paving the way for second Scottish independence referendum - Evening Standard\" [[User:Seagull123]] 21:19, 25 June 2016 (UTC)",
